  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IC World&#x2019;s Children&#x2019;s Prize Foundation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Intern styrning och kontroll ISK av World&#x2019;s Children&#x2019;s Prize Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the spring of 2025, Sida launched a call for proposal for Swedish civil society organisations for project support between 1 and 5 million SEK per year. World&#x2019;s Children&#x2019;s Prize Foundation has submitted an application which is currently undergoing review by Sida. Since Sida need more information about the internal control of the organisation, a decision has been taken to contract a consultant to perform an assessment based on these terms of reference.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xE5;ren 2025 utlyste Sida projektst&#xF6;d p&#xE5; mellan 1 och 5 miljoner kronor per &#xE5;r till svenska civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer. World&#x2019;s Children&#x2019;s Prize Foundation har l&#xE4;mnat in en ans&#xF6;kan som f&#xF6;r n&#xE4;rvarande granskas av Sida. Eftersom Sida beh&#xF6;ver mer information om organisationens interna kapacitet anlitar Sida konsultst&#xF6;d. Detta avropas p&#xE5; rangordnat ramavtal.</narrative>
  </description>
